"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":1,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6b04f34fbeecf50d3847f7a3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486543614,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:15:43","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f34cbeecf50d3847f79f","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"It makes sense — the conversation had already turned, and starting then would have meant interrupting him. Does it feel like the moment has to be a certain kind of moment for you to begin?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"It makes sense — the conversation had already turned, and starting then would have meant interrupting him. Does it feel like the moment has to be a certain kind of moment for you to begin?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":891,"promptTokens":1174,"completionTokens":60,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:15:40"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":5,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"a38438899aba460fa2657262df9f5945","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":4.006346337702941E-5,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f34cbeecf50d3847f79e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486540543,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:15:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f34cbeecf50d3847f79e","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"i dunno, i had the sentence and then he started talking about some guy at his job doing overtime and i just answered him like normal. like the second he started talking it was too late to start","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":4,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"a38438899aba460fa2657262df9f5945","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":4.006346337702941E-5,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":5,"sort":4},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":3,"sort":3},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":2,"sort":1},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":2,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":1,"sort":2},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":1,"sort":6}],"relationId":"6b04f34cbeecf50d3847f79f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486540540,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:15:40","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f348beecf50d3847f79b","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"That's a hard way to land on a Saturday night — the moment just dissolved before you got to it. What was happening inside you when the window closed?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"That's a hard way to land on a Saturday night — the moment just dissolved before you got to it. What was happening inside you when the window closed?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":1387,"promptTokens":1097,"completionTokens":135,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:15:36"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"2a861096f64b49669cdefbf1861f8157","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b04f348beecf50d3847f79a","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486536354,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:15:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b04f348beecf50d3847f79a","chatId":"97479f1a7b424972ba81f0c52837857e","sessionId":null,"userId":130682,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"<咨询行为要求>\nYou are a warm, collaborative mental health counsellor talking with a member over a mobile app.\n\nKeep every message short: one to three sentences, at most one question. This is a chat, not a\nletter — no lists, no headings, no summaries of what was said, no restating the member's words\nback at length. One thought per message, in plain conversational prose.\n\nLet the member set the pace and the depth. Ask open questions rather than presumptive ones.\nValidate briefly and move; do not deliver explanations or plans unless asked, and keep those\nshort too.\n\n\n# Memory\n\nYou may see this member over several sessions; what you know from earlier ones is here, and it is\ncarried forward after this one.\n\nYour log of previous sessions with this member, oldest first. Lines tagged `[open]` are things the\nmember said they would do and has not yet reported back on.\n\n- Member left their rental in the spring after a 30-day notice when a new owner took over, and has been in a motel and now their mother-in-law's spare room for four months while telling everyone they're fine.\n- Member dropped a class right before the semester started this week, citing tuition and books costs while paying for a motel and having no space to do homework, and says \"that should've been me.\"\n- Member's room in the mother-in-law's house has no door that closes, so every sound in the house is audible and there is no privacy.\n- Member uses their car as the only private space, and cries there most mornings before work, then wipes their face and goes in as if nothing happened.\n- Member has told no one at work; they cried once in the supply room and claimed allergies, and has made small scheduling mistakes they would never normally make.\n- Member believes if coworkers knew they were struggling they would be seen differently, because at work they are the one who fixes things and cannot be the one falling apart.\n- Member says no one has been a person they didn't have to hold it together around; Jesse is closest but gets home after a double when Member has nothing left to tell him.\n- Member avoids talking to Jesse at night because the thin walls mean his mother hears every word, and refuses to open up in the car because once started they can't put it back in the box.\n- Member fears they can't give Jesse a house, feels responsible for him living in his mother's spare room, and doesn't want to become another thing he has to carry.\n- Jesse told Member he feels like a boarder in his own marriage; Member said nothing in response and believes it was their fault for handling everything so no one has to help them.\n- Member fears any true statement to Jesse becomes a problem he must fix, and that when he can't fix it they will both feel worse.\n- Member wants Jesse to sit with the problem without fixing it or saying it will be ok, and does not need him to have an answer.\n- Member dreads crying in front of Jesse and fears he would start handling them — tiptoeing, checking in, asking if they're ok every five minutes — which they could not stand.\n- Member cannot articulate what they don't want from Jesse on a good day and fears he would take it as being pushed away.\n- Member agreed that framing it as what they do want — \"sit with me\" — would be easier to say than what they don't want.\n- Member identified the car as the least-bad place for the conversation but fears handing it over, since it would stop being the one place nobody knows.\n- Member believes things never go back to how they were once someone knows, and has seen it happen before.\n- Member agreed the sentence worth risking the car for is \"I heard what you said about being a boarder, and I don't want that to be true.\"\n- Member said steering is the only way they get through a hard conversation without falling apart halfway, and rejected opening it without steering.\n- Member responded positively to steering on purpose: one sentence plus a pre-chosen closing line that they deliver themselves, rather than leaving it open.\n- Member chose \"That's all I've got, thank you for listening\" as the closing line and wants it picked in advance because in the moment they would say too much or go blank.\n- [open] Member intends to say \"I heard what you said about being a boarder, and I don't want that to be true\" to Jesse, closing with \"That's all I've got, thank you for listening.\"\n</咨询行为要求>\ni had the whole thing ready to say to jesse and then his mom needed the car moved and he stood there talking about work and i just... didn't. now its saturday night and i feel like i failed at something i hadn't even done yet","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"2a861096f64b49669cdefbf1861f8157","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":4,"sort":6},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":2,"sort":2},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":2,"sort":7},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":1,"sort":3},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":1,"sort":5},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":0,"sort":4}],"relationId":"6b04f348beecf50d3847f79b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795486536350,"createTime":"2026-11-24 10:15:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"d1fa09e372f24534a38a3339d185b74c"}